// Template for local secrets. Copy this file to:
//   ../../Config/Secrets.xcconfig   (i.e. sibling of Movter.xcodeproj, NOT inside this folder)
// and fill in real values. That location is outside git, so the file is never committed.
//
// It is NOT a way to keep these keys secret from people running the app. Xcode
// substitutes both values into Info.plist at build time, so they ship inside the app
// bundle in cleartext and anyone with a copy of the build can read them back out.
// Treat them as public: use keys you are willing to expose, and rely on TMDB's and the
// Guardian's rate limits rather than on secrecy. A key that must actually stay secret
// has to live behind a server the app calls, not in the bundle.
TMDB_API_KEY = your_tmdb_api_key
GUARDIAN_API_KEY = your_guardian_api_key
